{
  "info": {
    "name": "SC3 Pembelian & Penerimaan Barang API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Postman collection for the SC3 procurement backend (Fastify + Prisma + MySQL). All endpoints use JSON bodies and responses follow the standard `{\"success\": true, \"data\": {...}, \"message\": \"...\"}` format; errors use `{\"success\": false, \"error\": \"...\", \"details\": ...}`.\n\nAturan penting (implementasi berjalan):\n- Item create body hanya `{name, itemCategoryCode, brandCode, uom}` — `code`, `sequence`, dan `stock` di-generate otomatis oleh backend (code = {L1}-{L2}-{L3}-{brandCode}-{sequence}; stock mulai 0, hanya bergerak lewat Goods Receipt).\n- Item update hanya data master (`name`, `brandCode`, `uom`) — `stock` tidak dapat diubah manual.\n- List filter: Items `category_code` (bisa level 1/2/3, otomatis termasuk semua kategori turunannya) + `search`; PO `status` (open/partial/complete/cancelled, kapitalisasi bebas), `vendor` (id); tanggal: `date` (YYYY-MM-DD, hari yang sama) ATAU rentang inklusif `startDate`/`endDate` (startDate ≤ endDate); GR `po_id` (id) dengan filter tanggal yang sama.\n- Semua list endpoint mendukung pagination `skip` & `take` (opsional).\n- PO hanya bisa diupdate/cancel saat status `open` (dengan catatan cancel tidak boleh punya GR).\n- GR dibuat hanya untuk PO `open`/`partial`, `qtyDiterima` tidak boleh melebihi sisa, dan `tglGR` tidak boleh lebih awal dari `tglPO`; GR immutable (tidak ada edit/delete).",
    "version": "1.1.0"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health Check",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "health"]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Master - Items",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Items",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/items?category_code={{categoryCode}}&search={{search}}&skip={{skip}}&take={{take}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "items"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "category_code", "value": "" },
                { "key": "search", "value": "" },
                { "key": "skip", "value": "", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "take", "value": "", "disabled": true }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Item Detail",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/items/{{itemId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "items", "{{itemId}}"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Item",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"PP Homopolymer Natural\",\n  \"itemCategoryCode\": \"PPR\",\n  \"brandCode\": \"000\",\n  \"uom\": \"kg\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/items",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "items"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Item",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Updated Name\",\n  \"uom\": \"kg\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/items/{{itemId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "items", "{{itemId}}"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Item",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/items/{{itemId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "items", "{{itemId}}"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Item Stock",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
